# Trivy image-gate ignore list — see .github/actions/docker-build-and-test/action.yml.
#
# The release publish is blocked only by FIXABLE CRITICAL vulnerabilities. If a specific
# CVE is a false positive or an accepted, documented risk, add its ID here (one per line)
# to let the publish proceed without disabling the gate. Prefer fixing the dependency
# over ignoring it, and note why an entry is here.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # accepted: transitive dev-only dep, not reachable at runtime
